{
  "name": "YouTube Video Comments Sentiment & Competitor Product Complaint Miner",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ YouTube Video Comments Sentiment & Competitor Product Complaint Miner\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nAnalyze viewer comments on top YouTube reviews in your industry to extract feature requests and competitor pain points.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/youtube-comments-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/youtube-comments-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify YouTube Comments Scraper - Viewer Sentiment** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "10f35eb1-3d2c-4430-ae98-b0d10ceb0936",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **YouTube Comments Scraper - Viewer Sentiment** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "04eefb69-2e46-4a26-a534-c24bad03ee00",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "29e5e130-e37f-4140-a3a3-71ab9ea127fa",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
